OL,3,GNEWSATeen's anti-rat device could save
OL,4,Arailways millions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost teenagers hope to leave college
OL,7,Fwith good grades and friends for life.
OL,9,FBut enterprising engineering student
OL,10,FJackson Hall will finish his studies at
OL,11,FYork College having invented a device
OL,12,Fthat could save the rail industry
OL,13,Fmillions of pounds.
OL,15,FJackson was on a work placement with
OL,16,FAGH Engineering, a design consultancy
OL,17,Fin the city, when he came up with an
OL,18,Fidea for a screen to stop rats and
OL,19,Fother animals chewing through electric
OL,20,Fcables.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
